From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: renaud <rlpirou@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 10:02:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] BTC-CORE hooks: per-entity tracking range

Behind performance.per-entity-tracking-range.enabled (default false). With
the key off, TrackedEntity#getEffectiveRange is Paper's, behind one boolean
test, and BTCCoreAPI#setEntityTrackingRange stores nothing.

With the key on, the tracker starts from the range the entity carries
(Entity#btc$trackingRangeOverride) in place of the range of its type; the
rest of Paper's computation is unchanged (passengers, scaled distance, view
distance of the viewer). The override is read each time a range is worked
out, so changing it never removes the entity from the tracker.

The idea is SparklyPaper's "Add per-entity tracking range overrides"
(MrPowerGamerBR, SparklyPower), https://github.com/SparklyPower/SparklyPaper.
SparklyPaper carries no licence file: none of its text is copied, and its
re-adding of the entity to the tracker is not reproduced.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/level/ChunkMap.java b/net/minecraft/server/level/ChunkMap.java
index 5bc85ee77b0168e7981366126433bcb1c8846a9d..d35cbe3c509206ad634868ee32c8ad726dd883c0 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/level/ChunkMap.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/level/ChunkMap.java
@@ -1536,6 +1536,11 @@ public class ChunkMap extends SimpleRegionStorage implements ChunkHolder.PlayerP
             // Paper start - optimise entity tracker
             final Entity entity = this.entity;
             int range = this.range;
+            // BTCCore start - performance.per-entity-tracking-range
+            if (dev.btc.core.config.BTCCoreConfig.perEntityTrackingRangeEnabled) {
+                range = dev.btc.core.performance.TrackingRangeOverride.effective(range, entity.btc$trackingRangeOverride);
+            }
+            // BTCCore end - performance.per-entity-tracking-range
 
             if (entity.getPassengers() == ImmutableList.<Entity>of()) {
                 return this.scaledRange(range);
diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/Entity.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/Entity.java
index 64759da8d0926b4b0dbe7476cce0ea6a3493f974..a90b0d879e30c17fe6e9d17afaae15fa944b4816 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/entity/Entity.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/entity/Entity.java
@@ -388,6 +388,7 @@ public abstract class Entity
     private final int despawnTime; // Paper - entity despawn time limit
     public int totalEntityAge; // Paper - age-like counter for all entities
     public final io.papermc.paper.entity.activation.ActivationType activationType = io.papermc.paper.entity.activation.ActivationType.activationTypeFor(this); // Paper - EAR 2/tracking ranges
+    public int btc$trackingRangeOverride = dev.btc.core.api.BTCCoreAPI.TRACKING_RANGE_DEFAULT; // BTCCore - performance.per-entity-tracking-range
     // Paper start - EAR 2
     public final boolean defaultActivationState;
     public long activatedTick = Integer.MIN_VALUE;
